Soul Drain was added in '''Beta 51.0''' as a 0G spell that would simply deal 2 DMG to the user to let them draw a card. '''Beta 53.0''' changed it to make the user destroy a card of their choice from their hand for 2G and draw 2 new cards. If the destroyed card was a Lost Soul, its Dust would trigger.

=== Stats ===
SOUL Type: Determination

Cost:
* 0 (Post Beta 51.0)
* 2 (Post Beta 53.0, Current)
Effects:
* Deal 2 DMG to yourself to draw a card. (Post Beta 51.0)
* Burn a card in your hand to draw 2 cards. If it's a Lost Soul, trigger its Dust. (Post Beta 53.0, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
